WEBVTT

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:13.120
That special night will come
for the abducted princess.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:18.620
Though she is beyond the Human Realm,
imprisoned at the ends of the earth.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.750
Oh, yes. I'll ask Santa for them.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.950
The princess is looking forward
to Santa Claus coming?

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.290
Yes! She was happily...

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.330
...writing a letter to him.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.160
What's she doing writing
a letter to him? She's a captive.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.790
Do you think she's requesting a present?

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.660
Probably. But...

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:57.370
...this is the Demon Castle.
He's not taking requests from here!

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:03.290
Even so, I'd hate if she escaped
because she wanted it so badly.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.950
"Off to visit the Human Realm~"

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.950
Look what happened before...

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:09.000
Yes. Discover her objective
and plan before it's too late!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.120
Okay.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:21.830
Dear Santa, I want to go home. From: Sya.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:22.910
What?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.000
"Final Night"
"Sleeping Princess of the Demon Castle"

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.620
She's homesick?!

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.700
Seriously?

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:07.330
Wait, Santa's not even
the right person to ask for that.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.080
Have you checked with the princess about why?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.160
Not yet.

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.000
Then, we'll just have to ask.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.040
No, but she doesn't know that we read
her letter to Santa without permission--

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.250
I can't find the letter I wrote to Santa.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.080
Not here. Nope. Nope. Nope. Nope.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.080
Know where it is?

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.000
"(All) Know"

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.040
Demon King, what now?

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.700
Will you ask her now?

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:40.160
Princess. D-D-D-Do... er... Don't you...

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:41.540
Demon King!

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:47.040
Do-Don't you think time flies?
It's almost Christmas!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.040
I know, right?

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.370
You suck at this!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:55.200
You want to go home to pick up your
special Christmas woolen underwear?!

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.660
Yeah.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.200
It wasn't because you're homesick?!

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:05.700
I have these specially made ones...
in my bedroom... my favorite.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:10.330
A reason like that is unacceptable!
And to travel to your bedroom?

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.450
It was already a hassle
to get to the nearest city.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:16.290
Why would we deliberately return
a hostage back to their home?!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.330
Let's go if it's that important to you.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.370
Why are <i>you </i>giving the go ahead?

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:29.290
It'll just cause more trouble
if we don't let her, right?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.330
And then throwing a Christmas party
will be out of the question.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.410
Can't you go and come back in ten minutes?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.580
"Remembers previous escapes"

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:45.370
Fine.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:51.040
But! On one condition!
We absolutely must return immediately!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:56.250
"Special Quest"
"Obtain Special Christmas Woolen
Underwear and Sleep in Warmth"

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:00.750
"Human Realm, Goodereste Castle"

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.120
Wow, so this is your actual room.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.580
"Princess Aurora Sya Lis Goodereste's bedroom"

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.580
Wow, so this is your actual room.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.370
That's right.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.120
Hurry up and get what you need--

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.910
Look, these are my favorite dresses.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.250
How nice.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.250
You lost focus of your goal in a split second!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:27.910
Listen, you two! Especially you, Princess!
Great isn't here this time!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.080
So I'll have to be extra strict
to make up for his absence--

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.290
Look, photo album.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.000
--Hm?
--Wow.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.580
No!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.620
The castle will be in an uproar if
they find out the princess is back!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:41.040
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:46.080
Right. Woolen... Christmas ones...

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.870
It's exhausting without Great.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:52.620
Come on, cheer up.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.120
"Dogs become sad when
their masters leave them behind."

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.450
Bed... bed... My bed...

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.370
--Now we can finally return.
--Fluffy. So soft.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.120
--Yes.
--Fluffy. So soft.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.660
Highest quality bedding.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.580
"Right on cue"

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.580
I knew it!

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.330
"Gave her space since she was getting underwear"

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.330
Oh, no! How careless of us!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.120
"Gave her space since she was getting underwear"

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.120
There's no way she could resist that!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.330
A king-size bed, though I'm a princess.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:24.040
Oh, shut up! Princess, if we linger any longer--

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.290
Shh, Demon King!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:31.540
Is someone there?

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.540
Could it be?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.790
My dear Sya, have you returned?

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:41.450
This is bad, Demon King. We must warp at once!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.370
I can't. I need more time!

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.410
Sya, my dear?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.080
"Queen Goodereste"
"Aurora Nem Lis Goodereste"

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.080
Is that you, Sya?

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.660
"Pulled her out from here"

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.700
What the hell did you do?!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:19.910
Well, I brought her for emergencies.
I threw her out there without thinking!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:24.790
No way she's falling for that! That's a demon!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:29.750
And that's Queen Goodereste,
the princess' mother!

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:33.790
There's no way you can fool a mother!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:35.790
My dear Sya!

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.410
Shocked!

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:40.290
Welcome home! You came back.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:44.790
Come visit my room before
we announce this to the public!

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:47.700
It worked!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.830
I got a quick nap!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.910
With a mom like that,
I guess a kid could turn out like this.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.330
Yes.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:01.250
This is bad. She took the succubus
instead of the princess.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.790
But it would've been worse
if she took the real princess.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.950
We must rescue the succubus,

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.370
but returning the princess to
the Demon Castle is our top priority!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:15.000
Then, we'll save the succubus
after regrouping at the Demon Castle?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.790
Yeah. You good with that, Princess?

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.750
You'll never be able to save her
if we return without her.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.370
She can't revive here. Such cruel superiors.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.950
It's your fault that we're even in this mess!

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:31.580
I will retrieve the body double.

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.790
What?

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.950
One moment.
It'll be fine. I'll see this through.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:37.870
Princess...

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.700
I'm hyped up. Let's go.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:51.250
Uh, Princess. You know that we
must not be found, right?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.790
Though it's your own home.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:53.950
Yup.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:57.040
What's that dragging along the floor?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.450
A paladin!

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.000
Princess, we must hide!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.000
Okay.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.950
--All good!
--You're in plain sight, dammit!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.950
"Morgen the Paladin"

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.950
Where are you, fiend?!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.410
Oh, no, he'll spot us!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.540
Show yourselves!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.500
I feel like the humans are
purposely overlooking us.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.500
Yes...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.330
"Enjoying herself at home"

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.080
You can't find the intruders?

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.830
They're here. No question about it!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:36.790
There was brief interference
in the magical shield earlier

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.750
indicating demon presence!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.200
Curse you, demons.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:44.450
"Evening Star the Paladin"

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:44.450
You'll be caught the next time you cast magic!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.950
The man knows what he's doing.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:53.540
Yes, I don't think it'll go
as smoothly from here on out.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:57.200
Princess, you've got to actually hide this time.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.450
All good.

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.200
Find them!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.750
Demon King, he's headed this way.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.160
Dammit, there's no other way out.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:14.790
And he'll capture us if we use magic.
What to do?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.450
There must be... must be a way!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.870
Who's there?!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:31.750
Oh, it's just you, Morgen. Assist us.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.450
A close call!

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.830
This armor belongs to the huge
guy we just encountered?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:41.200
We were very fortunate.
Are you all right, Princess?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:47.250
I know him. Morning Star,
captain of the royal paladins.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.080
He's honorable and strong,
but I know his weakness.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.120
His weakness?

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.870
What is it?

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.120
It's...

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.120
It's...?

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:02.700
It's so warm in here.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:04.620
Zzz...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:07.250
Are you determined to <i>not </i>be helpful?!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.540
Princess. What is it? What's his weakness?

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:14.790
Hey, Morgen, you listening?
Accompany me to search for the intruders.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:26.700
Curse those demons. First, they abduct
the princess. What are they after now?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.080
"After woolen underwear"

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:36.450
Morgen, you're inattentive.
Put more effort into looking for the intruders.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:39.950
So the person who owns
this armor is called Morgen?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:44.870
It seems so. Let's slip away while he's talking.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:49.620
Morgen, do you slack off due to your
lack of familiarity with the princess?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.160
Now to slip away.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:57.660
Very well. I'll tell you some
childhood stories of the princess.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.250
Why'd you stop?

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.120
Why did you?

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:06.080
Back when the princess was six years old...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.790
Wh-What's this? I had a bad feeling and woke up.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:17.540
When she was six, she was in love with
a show called, <i>Magical Girl Miracle Cute</i>.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:21.000
The first time I met her, she said this to me...

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:27.370
Princess Sya. I am Evening Star,
a newly installed paladin.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:32.790
I tricked you. I'm not Princess Sya, I'm Miracle Sya!

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.290
Then, she told me...

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.790
I defeated Princess Sya!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:44.080
I hear she did this with all the paladins.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:47.580
Heartwarming, isn't it?
Do you feel closer to the princess now?

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.700
"Trying to assail Evening Star"

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.120
"Stopping her"

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.120
--Princess!
--When did you wake?

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.200
"Morgen thrashing about(?)"

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.200
What's wrong, Morgen?!

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:57.410
I'm just so deeply moved.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:01.620
I see. Then here's another story. Attend.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:07.000
When she was eight, she watched
a soap opera that was airing back then...

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:10.870
I heard that if you can tie a healing
cherry stem in a knot with your tongue,

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.080
you're a good kisser.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.950
What's it mean to be a good kisser?

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.870
--Hey, is it good be a good kisser?
--The curious princess went around asking the castle.

00:13:17.870 --> 00:13:20.040
--What's your tongue have to do with kissing?
--The curious princess went around asking the castle.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.910
What happens if you're a good kisser?

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:24.540
Morgen!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.330
"Continue"

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.330
Y-You sure?

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:33.000
Nobody gave her an answer, so I told her this...

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:38.160
Being a good kisser means,
uh, to become a fine lady.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:41.080
So I'll become a fine lady if I practice.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:48.200
Not happening. She can barely lick
ice cream with that short tongue of hers.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.040
Here.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.500
Princess, hold it in!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.330
We'll be found out!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:57.830
That's when she started having
a complex about her short tongue,

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.580
and she practiced tying
healing cherry stems every day

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:03.580
until she was abducted by the Demon King.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:10.160
The end. Feel like you know her better?

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.040
Now put more effort into
finding those intruders.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.370
That voice!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.200
What? D-Demons!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.500
--Crap!
--He saw us!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.540
I found them!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:28.200
--Wait!
--Wait for us!

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.830
Come back here!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:34.200
Not to worry. I know his weakness.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:38.790
He's a complete night owl who
can't do anything once the sun rises.

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.290
It's already dawn, so we'll be fine.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.200
Zzz...

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:50.750
Are all humans like this?!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:56.000
Plus... Plus, it's fine because I'm dreaming.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:00.750
All of that was terrible, but I'll be fine
once I can sleep in my room.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:06.410
When I wake again, I'll probably find out
that none of it ever happened!

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.410
The princess took...

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.250
...more damage than expected.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:17.200
Morning alert for the Nation of Goodereste.

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:21.540
We will be holding an official ceremony
for the return of Princess Syalis

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:25.750
at the royal balcony of Goodereste Castle.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:30.160
Oh, no, we must retrieve the succubus.
If she's discovered--

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:35.200
Regardless, it'll greatly affect the plan for
the battle between humans and demons!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.040
"Aurora Nem Lis Goodereste"

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.040
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle.</i>

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:52.370
Never. I won't let this go any further.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.370
Princess?

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.950
Do you have a plan?

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:05.450
Not at all.
I only got 15 minutes of sleep at the most.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.200
She's just grumpy from lack of sleep.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.250
I'll end this. Then I'll sleep in peace.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.120
How will you end this?

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:20.620
I'll take responsibility for my actions.
I've caused much confusion.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.660
But I'll do this my way.

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:29.370
Something's wrong.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:33.830
I knew it'd take more than ten minutes,
but it's already morning!

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:37.410
It's bad! We're getting a broadcast from
the Human Realm on the large display.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:49.040
It's started.
A sudden nationwide alert this morning

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.290
announced a ceremony for Princess Syalis' return.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.910
--Wh-What's going on?
--Christmas, what a day to come home!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.750
--Where are the demon king and the others?
--Christmas, what a day to come home!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:01.200
In celebration of Princess Syalis' return, hurrah!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.910
Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.080
Hurrah for Goodereste!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.290
"Hero's party, beat up from hard mode area"

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.290
I'm so glad she's returned.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.700
"Hero's party, beat up from hard mode area"

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.700
What a relief.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.750
The princess is back at the castle?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.410
--Hurrah!
--Princess!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.580
Now for a live speech from the princess!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.620
Go ahead now, Princess.

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:34.750
W-Wait, isn't that Cubey?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:35.790
How come?

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.250
Oh, yeah, yesterday,

00:17:37.250 --> 00:17:38.620
--I saw her readily agree to something
after Demon Cleric handed her money.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.750
--Argh! Argh!
--I saw her readily agree to something
after Demon Cleric handed her money.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.200
It's her own fault, then!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.200
I can't move.

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:00.370
What's going on?

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:07.580
Citizens, it is with joy that
I stand before you, alive.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:17.000
She's acting strange. She's turned her back
to us, but her speech continues.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.950
That was the princess!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.370
The princess is somewhere near there!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.910
It's magic! So you were the intruders!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.750
If they discover the body double...

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.790
There's no need to hide our magic any longer.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.700
But what is the princess planning to say?

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:36.790
P-Princess! What's she wearing?

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:37.790
Hey.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:43.830
That day, I was abducted and began
my life at the Demon Castle

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:47.000
where I got to know myself.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:52.500
In time, I realized that I wasn't
a hostage, but a princess,

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:58.410
which was only true because all of you loved me.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:02.910
And it is my duty as nobility
to live alongside you

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.040
and respond to those feelings.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.290
Princess...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.870
Maybe she's not planning to come back.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.000
What?

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:15.830
She said she'd take responsibility for
the confusion. Does she plan to stay?

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.200
Could she?

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:25.950
To respond to those feelings means to,
for example, enjoy seasonal events together,

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.870
share pain, help each other out...

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:34.290
...and occasionally cross scissors.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.000
Isn't she talking about her time here?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.160
What?!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:44.040
And as we shared those experiences,
I realized my great duty

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:48.200
to be a model for relations
between demons and humans.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.500
Let us continue to live alongside each other!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.200
Prepare to flee immediately!

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.700
I said I'd take responsibility, didn't I?

00:20:01.700 --> 00:20:04.120
B-But we must hurry!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:08.870
Though we must flee, I caused this confusion,

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:13.870
so it's my responsibility to put things
back to how they were.

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.540
Huh?

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.790
Give me your cloak.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:20.910
Wh-What?! Is that supposed to be my face?

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.120
What are you doing?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.750
Muahaha. I've caught you off guard!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.910
It is I, the demon king!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:37.540
I will abduct the princess yet again.
What a short-lived celebration.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:44.080
Prepare yourselves. You won't--shall not
see her for quite some time after this.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:46.040
Her acting is so sloppy!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.410
Minions, transport the princess and me at once.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.830
--Huh?
--Wh-Wh-What?!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:56.080
It's terrible! One claiming to be the
demon king has a seized the princess!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.910
The princess' horns are my quills.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.540
You really okay with this?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.410
--We're going back.
--Yeah.

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:05.250
Come back!

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:09.000
Princess!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.120
My dear Sya!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.040
You seem to be enjoying yourself!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.660
Go.

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:19.660
What? You're leaving just like that?

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:20.870
Yeah.

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:28.330
Demon King, return the princess!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:32.750
I've now returned things to how they were.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:34.410
Good work, body double.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:43.790
It's been a while since I've done
a proper job as princess... Mother.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:51.450
Nonetheless, that demon king is rather cute.

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:36.410
By the way, did you get the item you needed?

00:22:36.410 --> 00:22:37.910
The woolen underwear!

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:39.290
We forgot them!

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:42.500
What the heck was that trip for?!

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:50.580
Aren't they cute?

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:00.120
Finally, the end to a long night.

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:12.160
Zzz...

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:19.370
"Quest Complete"

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.910
Great! Fantastic! Amazing! Excellent work!

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:34.250
My dear Sya, thank you
for a wonderful Christmas.

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:35.410
See you soon.

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:39.160
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i>.
